graph LR
    accTitle: User Entry Points and Client Caching Flow
    accDescr: Left-to-right diagram showing User interactions with CLI and SDK flowing through Workflows, Endpoints, Client, API, and Caches
    User --> |runs| CLI
    User --> |imports| SDK
    CLI --> |uses| Workflows
    SDK --> |exposes| Endpoints
    Workflows --> |call| Endpoints
    Endpoints --> |delegate| Client
    Client --> |talks to| API
    Client --> |uses| Cache["(Caches)"]
